docs {
  # Create Trip Day - Day 2 (Tokyo Immersion)

  Example SIGHTSEEING day focused on central Tokyo.

  ## Day Outline
  - Morning: Meiji Shrine + Harajuku exploration
  - Afternoon: Shibuya Crossing + shopping districts
  - Evening: teamLab Borderless + sushi dinner reservation

  ## Tips
  - Times are local to `Asia/Tokyo`
  - `trip_id` is set to 1 for sample data – update to match your database
  - Keep activities array ordered chronologically for easier UI rendering
}
